Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.82,0:00:02.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.63,0:00:03.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-这位是  -梅格\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's... - Meg.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.96,0:00:05.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是个恶魔  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a demon, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.45,0:00:08.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记得我吗  我可记得你哦  小天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember me? I sure remember you, Clarence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.23,0:00:10.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从批萨男那里学来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I learned that from the pizza man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.85,0:00:12.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她在逃命  就是说  你们在躲克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's running. Which means you're running from Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.94,0:00:14.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫娜奥米  我们救了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Naomi. We rescued you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.91,0:00:16.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥  他们在控制我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're controlling us, Castiel!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.68,0:00:19.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了他  这是命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill him! This is a direct order!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.20,0:00:20.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did I just do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.27,0:00:22.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你告诉温彻斯特兄弟萨曼德里奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell the Winchesters that Samandriel had been... 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.22,0:00:23.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,变节了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Compromised.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.22,0:00:24.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你只得  -自卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You acted in... - Self-defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.98,0:00:26.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡  你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.19,0:00:30.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有一块碑  就是说还有神之语\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's another tablet? So, another word of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.54,0:00:33.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥  天使石碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}The angel tablet, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.51,0:00:34.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克劳力知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.77,0:00:36.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上帝建立了一系列测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}God built a series of tests.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.50,0:00:38.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等你都完成了  就可以去关门了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you've done all three, you can slam the gates of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.48,0:00:39.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  我没能通过测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, I didn't pass the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.75,0:00:42.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我通过了  剩下的都让我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I did. And I'm doing the rest of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.33,0:00:44.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡  你在听吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, you got your ears on?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.01,0:00:47.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,照顾一下我弟弟  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep a lookout for my little brother, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.75,0:00:53.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.11,0:01:18.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  小卡  不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Cass. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.85,0:01:23.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  小卡  求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Cass, don't. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.61,0:01:53.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毫无迟疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}No hesitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.29,0:01:55.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干净利落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick. Brutal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.98,0:01:57.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切都恢复正常了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's back in order.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.73,0:01:59.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.92,0:02:02.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你终于准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.46,0:02:11.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.70,0:02:17.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第8季第17集]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.11,0:02:25.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.81,0:02:29.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.56,0:02:33.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,命运之矛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spear of destiny?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.39,0:02:35.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算什么  上帝的牙签吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this -- God's toothpick?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.72,0:02:40.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说这些混蛋就不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, would it have killed these asshats
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.10,0:02:43.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用点人看得懂的字做标签吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}to label these boxes in something other than hieroglyphics?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.08,0:02:45.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真受不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.53,0:02:53.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听见了没啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. You listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.08,0:02:55.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.74,0:02:58.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挺不错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's, uh... fascinating stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.22,0:02:59.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should probably, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.05,0:03:02.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都写进你的记录以便存档\N{\fnArial\fs30}write it all down in your journal for the archives, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.63,0:03:04.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢了  你真是帮了大忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, thanks. You're a lot of help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.52,0:03:14.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.52,0:03:14.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,霍利戴医生(19世纪美国一位投机商)  你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Doc Holliday, you all right over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.17,0:03:19.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.39,0:03:20.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um... I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.43,0:03:22.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呛到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just, uh, wrong pipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.48,0:03:31.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(亚洲情色)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.76,0:03:35.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不赖啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.72,0:03:38.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来记录者也不都是呆子嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}These men of letters weren't so boring after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.12,0:03:44.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Konnichiwa.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.83,0:03:46.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快瞧瞧这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.19,0:03:48.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有什么毛病啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.35,0:03:48.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我什么毛病\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.99,0:03:50.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开玩笑呢  这可是初版啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kidding me? This is a first edition, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.48,0:03:52.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道这东西在易趣网上能卖多少钱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what this would go for on eBay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.32,0:03:54.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道  怎么  你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Why? Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.13,0:03:56.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.56,0:03:57.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许知道吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.80,0:03:59.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴吧你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.86,0:04:00.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You find anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.82,0:04:01.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did, yeah --
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.55,0:04:04.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,中西部地区上周发现多具尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, dead bodies showing up all over the midwest last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.04,0:04:08.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,印第安纳州  本顿  伊利诺伊州  丹尼森市\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benton, Indiana; Downers Grove, illinois;
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.27,0:04:09.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,密执根  诺维\N{\fnArial\fs30}uh, Novi, Michigan;
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.42,0:04:12.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚密苏里州  林肯泉也死人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then again last night in Lincoln Springs, Missouri.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.13,0:04:13.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这跟我们什么关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how is this us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.21,0:04:14.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为所有的死者均有严重灼伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because each of the victims had severe burns
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.90,0:04:16.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,眼睛周围  手和脚都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}around their eyes, hands, and feet,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.82,0:04:19.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,手背有穿透伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}puncture wounds through the backs of their hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.04,0:04:22.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,眼睛和内脏被液化\N{\fnArial\fs30}eyes and internal organs liquefied.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.08,0:04:24.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我们的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sounds like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.19,0:04:24.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.91,0:04:26.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且死者之间毫无关联\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also, no link between any of the victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.85,0:04:28.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个地产商\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, one was a real-estate agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.38,0:04:30.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个当地的历史学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another was a local historian.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.31,0:04:31.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚死去的女人是个老师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Woman killed last night was a teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.79,0:04:33.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,山羊吸血怪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, chupacabra.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.67,0:04:35.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么  控制不住发狂了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we got? Power tools gone rogue?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.60,0:04:36.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait -- are we talking
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.84,0:04:39.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.84,0:04:39.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是《火魔战车》那种情况吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}a-a "Maximum overdrive" situation here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.85,0:04:40.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.00,0:04:42.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,值得去瞧瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worth a shot, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.12,0:04:44.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去拿东西  我们五分钟后出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll grab my gear. We should probably leave in five.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.41,0:04:48.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然  除非你要多花点时间陪十月小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}'less, of course, you need some more time with miss October.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.41,0:04:49.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.13,0:04:54.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  十分钟吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, make it 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.40,0:05:13.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只想问几个关于你妻子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just have a few routine follow-up 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.15,0:05:15.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,常规后续问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}questions about your wife, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.87,0:05:17.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她有仇家吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did she have any enemies?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.56,0:05:18.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ann?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.67,0:05:22.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说实话  我想不出任何人会想伤害她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly, I can't think of a soul who'd want to hurt her,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.17,0:05:23.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使发生了那些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}even after everything that happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.85,0:05:25.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生了哪些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything that happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.51,0:05:28.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一周前安发生了些变化\N{\fnArial\fs30}About a week ago, something changed in Ann.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.23,0:05:32.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她很反常  很易怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was out of sorts, not herself at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.92,0:05:34.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么个易怒法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of sorts how?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.63,0:05:37.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我带你们去看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'd be better if I show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.12,0:05:39.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她不睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}She stopped sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.18,0:05:41.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}She stopped eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.18,0:05:43.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大半夜跑出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}She went out in the middle of the night,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.34,0:05:44.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不知是去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}going God knows where.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.93,0:05:48.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想跟她沟通\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to talk to her, but, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.95,0:05:50.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可她只是喃喃自语\N{\fnArial\fs30}she would just mutter to herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.96,0:05:52.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.89,0:05:56.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟什么果园有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something... about an orchard?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.31,0:06:00.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后来有一晚我跟上了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally, I just followed her one night,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.88,0:06:02.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她去了操场\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she went to the playground.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.84,0:06:04.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是小学这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here -- the elementary school.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.94,0:06:07.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后她开始挖\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she started digging.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.02,0:06:10.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她带着几个装满土的小袋子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She would leave with these little bags full of dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.69,0:06:12.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挂在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hung them here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.51,0:06:16.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些袋子都代表了她在地上挖的洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}All these bags represent holes that she dug in the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.29,0:06:20.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些洞  有六英尺深吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were these holes, uh -- I don't know -- 6 feet deep?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.90,0:06:21.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.11,0:06:23.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她一挖就几小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}She dug for hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.18,0:06:24.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全不知道累\N{\fnArial\fs30}She never broke a sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.67,0:06:27.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直挖10到15英尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Straight down 10, maybe 15 feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.82,0:06:30.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还注意到其他事了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you notice anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.36,0:06:36.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没跟警察说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't say anything to the cops
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.93,0:06:39.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想让他们认为我疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I didn't want them to think I was crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.92,0:06:41.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安回家后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After Ann came home,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.57,0:06:43.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来这儿跟她对质\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came down here to confront her,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.78,0:06:44.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她当时正打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she was on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.72,0:06:46.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道她在跟谁通话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any idea who she was talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.04,0:06:47.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.37,0:06:48.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我知道我看到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I know what I saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.36,0:06:50.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不是我的安妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it wasn't my Annie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.44,0:06:54.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喊了她的名字  她的眼睛...\N{\fnArial\fs30}After I called her out, her eyes...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.10,0:06:57.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,变成黑色的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They turned black.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.53,0:07:03.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  这一定是我想出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I-I know I must have imagined it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.00,0:07:05.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定是这样  但我出门了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I did. But I-I left.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.54,0:07:07.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去了酒吧  大概多喝了两杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went to the bar, probably had too much to drink,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.55,0:07:08.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等我回来的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}and by the time I came back...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.85,0:07:14.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的安妮已经...\N{\fnArial\fs30}...my Annie was, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.42,0:07:19.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不该出去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have stayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.80,0:07:22.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我该保护她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have protected her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.30,0:07:26.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我今天要搬去我姐姐家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm moving into my sister's place today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.98,0:07:29.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能再待在这儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't be here anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.72,0:07:31.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.25,0:07:35.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常感谢你的配合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, um, thank you very much for your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.38,0:07:38.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们深表哀悼\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're both very sorry for your loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.06,0:07:42.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人在杀恶魔  真是太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, somebody's killing demons. Well, that is awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.41,0:07:44.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我们该送花或者感谢卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel like we should send a card or flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.46,0:07:46.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪种花的花语是"谢谢你杀恶魔"\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of flower says "Thanks for killing demons"?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.45,0:07:48.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是谁在杀恶魔  又是为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but who's killing demons? And why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.89,0:07:51.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再者  被恶魔附身的人怎么还\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, by the way, since when does a demon possess someone,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.57,0:07:52.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,突然变成了天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}then go all "Beautiful mind"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.73,0:07:55.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到处去挖土了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and -- and start digging in the dirt?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.10,0:07:56.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得这对劲吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does any of this seem right to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.82,0:07:59.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢杀恶魔的部分  挺对劲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like the part about killing demons. That sounds right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.14,0:08:06.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.07,0:08:07.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.86,0:08:10.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常感谢你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, thank you very much for all your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.25,0:08:12.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是麻烦你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really appreciate the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.29,0:08:13.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.12,0:08:17.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地产商的妻子也说他行为古怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, real-estate guy's wife said he was acting weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.33,0:08:19.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,历史学家的丈夫也这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, historian's hubby said the same --
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.32,0:08:22.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也是突然执迷古怪了起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}just got all obsessive and then weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.58,0:08:24.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但没人看到黑眼珠\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one saw any black eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.04,0:08:26.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是  无风不起浪嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}but still, where there's smoke, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.63,0:08:28.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道他们都在找什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder what they're all looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.51,0:08:30.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,温迪·赖斯是最后跟安说话的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Wendy Rice here was the last person to speak with Ann, 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.81,0:08:32.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看她会怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}so let's see if she can tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.90,0:08:39.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,林恩特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Special agent Lynne.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.65,0:08:41.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我搭档坦迪特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my partner, special agent Tandy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.26,0:08:43.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们想就安·莫顿问你几个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd like to ask you a few questions about Ann Morton.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.86,0:08:47.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然了  请进吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, uh, uh, of course. Please come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.83,0:08:55.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那天她来电话之前我从没见过她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had never met her before she called the other night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.47,0:08:58.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她打电话是什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, why was she calling you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.61,0:09:01.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是想找一张城市最早的地图\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was looking to find an original map of the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.58,0:09:04.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她说要干什么用了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did she say what for?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.34,0:09:07.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她没说  但是她提到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, she -- she didn't, but she did mention
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.37,0:09:09.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一片消失的果园\N{\fnArial\fs30}an -- an old orchard that had gone missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.84,0:09:10.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.07,0:09:13.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这座小镇曾被夷为平地\N{\fnArial\fs30}This -- this town was wiped from the earth
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.93,0:09:16.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是场百年不遇的洪水\N{\fnArial\fs30}by one of the river's 100-year floods.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.00,0:09:17.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在的小镇是重建的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was -- it was rebuilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.96,0:09:21.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但原始的记录都遗失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But all the original records were -- were lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.93,0:09:24.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是名博士候选人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm -- I'm a PhD candidate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.66,0:09:28.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我的研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this -- this is my research.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.47,0:09:29.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.64,0:09:34.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的论文是关于小镇的历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}my dissertation is -- is on the history of this town
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.02,0:09:36.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它与地下铁路的联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, uh, its connection to the underground railroad
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.57,0:09:38.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and -- and -- and whatnot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.49,0:09:42.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些年  我研究的一部分就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been working to re-create a map 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.58,0:09:44.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,重划一张地图\N{\fnArial\fs30}for years as part of my research,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.18,0:09:47.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而这里就是贾库比卡果园旧址\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this -- this is the old Jakubiak orchard there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.40,0:09:51.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我昨天发现是在唐尼和邦德街街口\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found out yesterday it's where Downey meets Bond street.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.18,0:09:53.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安有说过她为什么要找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, did Ann say why she was looking
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.23,0:09:55.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果园的旧址了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the site of an old orchard?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.32,0:09:56.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.78,0:10:00.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们约好见面  她却没有来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We -- we set a time to meet, and she never showed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.76,0:10:03.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我就在报纸上看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I read about her in the paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.93,0:10:06.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真惨啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just tragic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.32,0:10:10.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过安的助手今早来电话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ann's assistant called this morning, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.29,0:10:12.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问地图是否还在我手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}asking if I still had the map.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.72,0:10:14.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,助手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Assistant?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.86,0:10:17.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概就是他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's probably him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.60,0:10:19.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许他能帮你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.90,0:10:28.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Are -- are you --
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.58,0:11:21.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个放在你肩上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put this on your shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.66,0:11:24.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.04,0:11:26.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有个恶魔跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other demon escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.06,0:11:29.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我抓到的那个我放在恶魔陷阱里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bound the one I caught in a devil's trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.01,0:11:30.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这就去审问她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna interrogate it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.13,0:11:31.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second. Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.46,0:11:33.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你先回答我们几个问题吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about you answer some questions first?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.97,0:11:35.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比如  你最近都去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, where the hell have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.73,0:11:40.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你听到我了  是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard me, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.82,0:11:43.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你向他祈祷了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You prayed to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.62,0:11:46.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  我听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I heard you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.57,0:11:48.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我来不是为了那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's not why I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.27,0:11:51.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在四处猎恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been hunting demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.47,0:11:56.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是你干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.37,0:11:58.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.41,0:11:59.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}What should I tell them?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.17,0:12:02.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.88,0:12:04.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少是大部分事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most of it, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.65,0:12:07.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许他们能帮我们更近一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they can get us closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.04,0:12:11.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在到处找恶魔石碑的另一半\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been searching for the other half of the demon tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.43,0:12:12.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不带我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.92,0:12:16.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是想帮忙  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been trying to help, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.81,0:12:17.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在搜寻过程中\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in my search, 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.71,0:12:21.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我发现克劳力派恶魔到处找路西法的地宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I uncovered that Crowley has sent out demons to find Lucifer's crypts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.55,0:12:23.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,路西法的地宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer had crypts?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.08,0:12:24.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且还有几十个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dozens of them, apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.66,0:12:26.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那他们到处挖土是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why the storage wars?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.04,0:12:27.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们到底在找什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what the hell are they all looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.79,0:12:30.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他们知道全部实情会更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would be more helpful if they knew everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.54,0:12:32.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们不能信任他们  -但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They cannot be trusted. - But --
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.22,0:12:34.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,撒谎  卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lie, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.53,0:12:37.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我们说好的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell them what we discussed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.44,0:12:39.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们在找一张羊皮纸\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're looking for a parchment 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.59,0:12:42.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好破解克劳力手里的恶魔石碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}that would allow them to decipher Crowley's half of the demon tablet
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.09,0:12:44.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样就不需要先知了\N{\fnArial\fs30}without a prophet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.04,0:12:45.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶魔解码器\N{\fnArial\fs30}A demonic decoder ring?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.76,0:12:47.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被克劳力拿到\N{\fnArial\fs30}In Crowley's hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.44,0:12:48.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.42,0:12:52.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地宫的位置早已失传\N{\fnArial\fs30}The crypts were, uh, lost over time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.32,0:12:55.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有那些路西法的亲信才知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only those closest to Lucifer knew their whereabouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.75,0:12:57.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那克劳力怎么找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then how did Crowley find them?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.16,0:12:58.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的恶魔附身了一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}His demons have been possessing locals
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.92,0:13:01.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道特定事情的当地人\N{\fnArial\fs30}who may have some special knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.12,0:13:04.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以安的屋里会布置成那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would explain the crazy room at Ann's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.44,0:13:08.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他们怎么知道该去哪找呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But how did they know where to start looking in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.41,0:13:09.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.12,0:13:10.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望厨房里那个发型特异的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hoping the strange-haired demon in the kitchen
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.83,0:13:13.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比我审过的其他恶魔能知道的更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}is more knowledgeable than the others I interrogated.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.42,0:13:19.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是混蛋版的小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he puts the "ass" in "Cass," Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.46,0:13:21.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他绝对有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's definitely off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.65,0:13:22.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Off?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.63,0:13:25.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他从炼狱回来就没正常过\N{\fnArial\fs30}He hasn't been right since he got back from purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.68,0:13:27.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且我们还不知道他到底怎么出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We still don't know how he got out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.76,0:13:29.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可话说回来  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.26,0:13:31.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然他这么不对劲  你怎么还向他祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he's so sketchy, then why were you praying to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.94,0:13:38.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能听到你们说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I can hear you both.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.00,0:13:39.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可是天使啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a celestial being.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.04,0:13:48.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆和迪恩·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam and Dean Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.90,0:13:52.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她对你们俩很感兴趣呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, the thoughts she had about you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.90,0:13:55.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤其是你  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mostly you, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.21,0:13:57.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.66,0:14:00.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她就是喜欢嫩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has a thing for smutton chops.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.71,0:14:02.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了  你个二货\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you douchebag, listen --
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.13,0:14:13.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地宫的事是谁告诉你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who told you about the crypts?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.25,0:14:19.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使不是唱红脸的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought angels were supposed to be the good cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.11,0:14:22.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.61,0:14:24.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.26,0:14:26.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有人质\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a hostage!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.16,0:14:33.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克劳力的走狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's one of Crowley's pets.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.57,0:14:36.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她住在州际公路边的莫里旅馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's at the Murray hotel, down by the interstate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.23,0:14:38.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她知道镇上的地宫都埋在了哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}She knows the towns where all the crypts are buried.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.47,0:14:40.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她当年看到过\N{\fnArial\fs30}She saw them all back in the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.21,0:14:43.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,羊皮纸的事也是她说的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she told you about the parchment?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.83,0:14:47.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么羊皮纸\N{\fnArial\fs30}What parchment?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.52,0:14:51.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他可不是唯一唱白脸的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think he's the only bad cop in this room?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.78,0:14:53.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被骗我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop lying!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.38,0:14:54.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们知道你们到底想找什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know what you're really looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.62,0:14:55.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.49,0:14:57.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说了  我们在找\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am telling you, we're looking...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.38,0:14:58.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.18,0:14:59.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找\N{\fnArial\fs30}For...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.21,0:15:00.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.12,0:15:04.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这是干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.08,0:15:05.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要知道的都问出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It told us what we needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.13,0:15:06.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  没有  你不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, she didn't! You can't just --
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.21,0:15:07.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我独自一人搜寻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I started this hunt without you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.77,0:15:09.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是不想被人拖后腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I didn't want anything to slow me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.03,0:15:11.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得马上去旅馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to get to the motel now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.40,0:15:12.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on a second --
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.73,0:15:14.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-小卡  -小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cass! - Cass? Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.04,0:15:15.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死  快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it. Go. Go. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.60,0:15:23.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那儿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}There. There.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.05,0:15:39.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多谢等我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.14,0:15:41.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人质在那间屋里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hostage is in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.16,0:15:56.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你做突击队是不是矮了点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you a little short for a stormtrooper?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.46,0:16:02.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得问问\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I got to ask. Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.23,0:16:05.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,头发是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up with the hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.53,0:16:07.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.34,0:16:09.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多谢你注意到了  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aww. Thanks for noticing, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.58,0:16:11.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这是克劳力弄的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this wasn't my idea. It was Crowley's.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.38,0:16:14.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也是我想一刀插他脸上的另一条理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's just another reason I want to stab him in the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.18,0:16:15.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.94,0:16:18.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你把路西法地宫的位置都告诉克劳力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been telling Crowley the location of Lucifer's crypts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.36,0:16:20.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没办法啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.30,0:16:23.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只想让他偶尔暂停对我的折磨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I needed a break from the constant torture.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.39,0:16:26.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟黄眼恶魔混的时候的确都去过\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I did visit them all during my time with yellow eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.95,0:16:27.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.79,0:16:30.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要紧的我都没说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't exactly been giving them the Glengarry leads.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.17,0:16:33.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你对他们撒谎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean you've been lying to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.94,0:16:36.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我给了个大概位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just get them in the ballpark.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.12,0:16:38.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过了这么久  肯定有所变化\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough time's passed and enough's changed
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.47,0:16:39.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们也信了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That they bought it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.00,0:16:41.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.63,0:16:45.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拖延时间啊  傻帽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buy myself some time, dummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.27,0:16:47.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想办法逃脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try to find a way to get free.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.71,0:16:50.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  死了那么多无辜的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait -- so... A bunch of innocent people died
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.18,0:16:52.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是为了让你拖延时间吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you could... buy yourself some time?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.40,0:16:55.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是梅格  我是个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. I'm Meg. I'm a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.09,0:16:59.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们找到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what have they found?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.70,0:17:01.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bupkis.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.62,0:17:04.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每次打开地宫都是一无所获\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every crypt's been one Al Capone's vault after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.17,0:17:07.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且还有人发现了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And on top of that, someone kept picking up the trail 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.44,0:17:09.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把他们杀掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and icing demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.18,0:17:11.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜是你吧  卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm guessing that was you, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.12,0:17:13.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但克劳力还是继续派人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Crowley just keeps sending more.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.89,0:17:15.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他决心要...\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's hell-bent on...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.28,0:17:18.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她会把实情说出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gonna tell them the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.68,0:17:21.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要杀了她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I have to kill her?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.54,0:17:26.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但她也知道地宫的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}She does know the location of the crypts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.44,0:17:30.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是跟恶魔合作是不检点的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But working with a demon is...unclean.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.81,0:17:33.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以像克劳力那样利用她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we could use her -- as Crowley did.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.84,0:17:36.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.51,0:17:41.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到天使石碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}...finding that angel tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.99,0:17:46.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.16,0:17:50.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"天使石碑"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you just say "Angel tablet"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.81,0:17:53.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在知道克劳力为什么喊你"小鹿"了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I get why Crowley calls you "Moose" Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.82,0:17:57.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  "天使石碑"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes -- "Angel tablet."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.04,0:17:59.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克劳力发现石碑本来在路西法手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley found out Lucifer had it,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.97,0:18:02.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,认定它一定藏在哪个地宫里\N{\fnArial\fs30}figures it's stashed in a crypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.49,0:18:05.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这我之前也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this is news to me, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.40,0:18:07.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我审过的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demons I interrogated,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.51,0:18:10.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定都没说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}they must have been lying about their true intentions.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.59,0:18:11.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.42,0:18:14.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看到你之前是怎么对付那个恶魔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I saw you "Zero dark thirty" that demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.73,0:18:16.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可很会逼供呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were more than persuasive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.28,0:18:20.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们都没抓住重点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're both missing the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.03,0:18:20.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我撒了谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lied to them,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.92,0:18:23.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以他们一直都没找对地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}which means they're digging in the wrong place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.20,0:18:25.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但不会很久了  他们很快就会回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not for long. They'll be back here soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.20,0:18:28.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁想逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, who's up for fleeing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.74,0:18:31.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她说得对  我们得赶在他们之前找到地宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's right. We need to find those crypts before they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.86,0:18:34.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,梅格  只有你去过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meg, you're the only one who's been there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.90,0:18:37.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要你帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.83,0:18:44.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们哪个傻帽有地图吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any of you dummies got a map?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.55,0:18:50.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那儿  地宫就在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}There. That's where the crypt was.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.00,0:18:51.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's there now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.14,0:18:54.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我长得像谷歌地图吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I look like google to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.07,0:18:57.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想当年这些楼都不存在呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of these buildings were here way back in the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.63,0:18:59.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己去查吧  天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}Figure it out, genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.70,0:19:01.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里有酒吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there any booze in this dump?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.97,0:19:07.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他撒谎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He lied to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.23,0:19:09.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许吧  但我能理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, maybe. I can kind of understand why.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.47,0:19:11.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可是天使石碑啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, an angel tablet?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.92,0:19:13.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果恶魔石碑能关上地狱大门\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the demon tablet can shut the gates of hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.49,0:19:14.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使石碑会有什么威力\N{\fnArial\fs30}what can the angel tablet do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.43,0:19:21.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些伤口都溃烂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}These wounds have festered.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.85,0:19:25.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可真会哄女人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really do know how to make a girl's nethers quiver, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.69,0:19:27.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的确知道要怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am aware of how to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.16,0:19:32.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是一般跟清理伤口无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although it doesn't usually involve cleaning wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.93,0:19:36.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么对我这么好  小天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you so sweet on me, Clarence?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.04,0:19:39.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.24,0:19:43.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.24,0:19:43.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我倒现在也不知道你为什么那么叫我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I still don't know who Clarence is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.12,0:19:46.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你去看个电影或者读本书能死啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would it kill you to watch a movie, read a book?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.42,0:19:48.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,电影不至于\N{\fnArial\fs30}A movie, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.41,0:19:51.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是如果是一本特定的咒语书\N{\fnArial\fs30}But a book with the proper spells --
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.12,0:19:53.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理论上讲的确能让我死掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it could, theoretically, kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.66,0:19:57.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不说话的时候更可爱一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you're much cuter when you're shutting up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.13,0:20:05.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在是什么样的小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, which Cass are you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.66,0:20:08.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出厂设置还是疯癫版的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Original make and model or crazy town?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.25,0:20:12.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.74,0:20:14.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你脑子又正常了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, your noodle's back in order?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.51,0:20:20.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的脑子都记起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, my...noodle remembers everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.29,0:20:21.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脑子应该挺不错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's a pretty good noodle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.72,0:20:22.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.04,0:20:24.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么都记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.14,0:20:32.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你是指披萨男\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're referring to the pizza man...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.53,0:20:35.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  那个我也记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I remember the pizza man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.54,0:20:38.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且是段愉快的记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's a good memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.42,0:20:44.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.94,0:20:45.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.97,0:20:46.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从这上面看\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to this,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.92,0:20:49.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地宫应该在一栋废楼下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}the crypt has to be below an abandoned building.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.59,0:20:51.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good times.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.76,0:20:55.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得我们能相信他俩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think we can trust, uh, Meg-stiel?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.14,0:20:57.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.88,0:20:59.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们又能怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what choice do we have?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.79,0:21:04.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怀念天启吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever miss the Apocalypse?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.93,0:21:07.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我为什么要怀念呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Why would I miss the end of times?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.59,0:21:10.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怀念那时的单纯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss the simplicity.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.99,0:21:12.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我那时很坏  你很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was bad. You were good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.49,0:21:14.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,生活轻松一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life was easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.41,0:21:16.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在一切都那么复杂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now it's all so messy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.48,0:21:21.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我似乎挺好  这样很不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm kind of good, which sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.94,0:21:23.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你似乎有点坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're kind of bad --
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.48,0:21:27.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这倒是挺性感的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is actually all manner of hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.55,0:21:32.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们安然度过这次\N{\fnArial\fs30}We survive this...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.46,0:21:34.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要点些匹萨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna order some pizza
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.90,0:21:36.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我们把家具挪挪位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we're gonna move some furniture around.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.63,0:21:38.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.82,0:21:39.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I-I --
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.85,0:21:44.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等下  其实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait -- actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.15,0:21:46.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I --
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.14,0:21:48.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  出发吧  驴友们\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Let's roll, campers.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.45,0:22:04.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.15,0:22:08.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把那里从上到下找了个遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh, searched the site top to bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.43,0:22:09.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是空的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.73,0:22:12.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  那里没有地宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, there's no crypt there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.81,0:22:15.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有...不仅如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh, that's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.09,0:22:17.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先生  现在只剩我一人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just me now, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.98,0:22:19.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.64,0:22:21.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可能弄丢了梅格\N{\fnArial\fs30}We may have lost Meg.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.91,0:22:24.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.79,0:22:27.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂  先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.67,0:22:30.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把话说清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just to be clear...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.03,0:22:35.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你找不到一个地洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}...you can't find a hole in the ground...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.05,0:22:40.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的帮手不幸早死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your coworkers have met with an untimely demise...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.50,0:22:48.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你弄丢了我最喜欢的磨牙玩具\N{\fnArial\fs30}...and you've lost my favorite chew toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.55,0:22:54.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.68,0:22:57.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那句老话怎么说来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that old expression?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.66,0:23:00.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"如果你想把事情做好"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"If you want something done right..."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.84,0:23:10.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}...blah, blah, blah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.67,0:23:19.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.28,0:23:21.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在地下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Basement?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.74,0:23:22.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我和小卡进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Cass and I will head in
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.90,0:23:24.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一探究竟\N{\fnArial\fs30}and get our Indiana Jones on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.07,0:23:25.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  你和梅格待在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, you stay outside with Meg.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.69,0:23:27.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-什么  -我们能行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - We got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.03,0:23:27.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么呢  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.77,0:23:29.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不会让你一个人进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not letting you go in there alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.33,0:23:31.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他不是一个人  -我不是那个意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He won't be alone. - That's not what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.65,0:23:33.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,梅格可以待在这里  帮我们把风\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meg can hang here, watch our backs.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.45,0:23:35.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么  现在你又相信梅格了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, what? Now you trust Meg?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.47,0:23:36.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都帮你们这么多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I got you this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.88,0:23:37.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-闭嘴  -闭嘴  梅格\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shut up. - Shut up, Meg.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.40,0:23:38.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean --
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.18,0:23:41.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  我看到垃圾桶里你沾血的手帕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, I saw your bloody rag in the trash can, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.27,0:23:46.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-那不是...  -够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That wasn't... - Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.66,0:23:48.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.46,0:23:51.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  我们不知道里面有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, we don't know what's in there, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.45,0:23:53.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之前你差点被一个恶魔干掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you almost let a demon get the best of you back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.65,0:23:55.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我没事  -不  你有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm fine. - No, you're not fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.07,0:23:56.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第一项测试开始你就很不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't been fine since the first trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.89,0:23:58.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我才叫来了小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I called Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.57,0:23:59.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,测试  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Trial? 
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.38,0:24:00.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-闭嘴  梅格  -闭嘴  梅格\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shut up, Meg. - Shut up, Meg.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.52,0:24:03.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我告诉你  我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I'm telling you -- I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.86,0:24:05.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  你不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.85,0:24:06.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.24,0:24:10.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你受到的伤害  我都无法治愈\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're damaged in ways even I can't heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.55,0:24:13.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.22,0:24:16.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该待在这里  保护梅格\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should stay here and protect Meg.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.27,0:24:18.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我什么时候还需要保护了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since when do I need protecting?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.00,0:24:21.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你被抓并虐待拷问了一年多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since you were held captive and tortured for over a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.07,0:24:23.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Touche.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.13,0:24:27.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了  我们很快回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.74,0:24:46.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚你说萨姆怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what did you mean back there about Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.89,0:24:48.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一言难尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's difficult to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.95,0:24:52.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是亚原子层面的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's something on the subatomic level
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.49,0:24:53.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而他的电磁场\N{\fnArial\fs30}and his electromagnetic field --
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.88,0:24:55.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,简单点说  比尔·内(美著名科普专家)\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, bottom-line it for me, Bill Nye.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.82,0:24:57.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-致命吗  -不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is it lethal? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.67,0:24:58.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.76,0:25:01.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里有风\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a draft.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.03,0:25:04.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这后面有东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something behind there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.45,0:25:08.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.83,0:25:20.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等下  我救过你们多少次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait -- so I took how many bullets for you guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.23,0:25:21.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们都没想来找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you didn't even look for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.63,0:25:25.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全没想过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, once?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.46,0:25:30.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真英武\N{\fnArial\fs30}My hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.79,0:25:37.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,测试和受伤什么的是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's with all the "Trial" and "Being damaged" crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.40,0:25:41.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恕我直言  但你并不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, no disrespect, but you haven't exactly been
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.67,0:25:45.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们遇到的最值得信赖的人  梅格\N{\fnArial\fs30}the most, uh, trustworthy person in our lives, Meg.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.42,0:25:47.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不打算告诉我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.15,0:25:49.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.62,0:25:51.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还算不上是你的朋友吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How am I not team Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.35,0:25:57.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.03,0:26:00.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管是什么  你愿意为此而死吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it is, you okay dying over it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.57,0:26:08.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不想说  好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want to say, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.27,0:26:11.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是记住  我曾经附在你身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}But remember, I spent time in that walking corpse of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.90,0:26:14.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你的悲伤  想法还有感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know your sad, little thoughts and feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.64,0:26:16.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真恐怖\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.86,0:26:20.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我记得是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's what I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.53,0:26:24.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,内心深处  被你深深埋起来的那部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deep down, in parts you never let see the light of day,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.17,0:26:25.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想过长久普通的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}you want to live a long, normal life
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.88,0:26:28.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,远离我这种恐怖的老东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}away from creepy old things like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.81,0:26:33.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.04,0:26:36.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去年和一个人...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I spent last year with...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.92,0:26:39.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一起度过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone, and, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.81,0:26:42.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我知道那是有可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}...Now I know that's actually possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.39,0:26:45.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  你就这样度过去年的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait -- that's how you spent your last year?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.03,0:26:47.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和一个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}With a chick?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.41,0:26:48.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真无聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.39,0:26:51.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们安静地等他们吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, how about we just wait quietly?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.96,0:26:53.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她叫什么名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was her name?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.60,0:26:56.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你连名字都不肯告诉我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't even trust me with a name?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.54,0:26:59.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是有感情的啊  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut me, do I not bleed, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.00,0:27:04.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有个女人居然能让你放弃猎魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, some chick actually got you off hunting, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.32,0:27:06.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那真是个了不起的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's one rare creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.88,0:27:07.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me --
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.19,0:27:10.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么遇见这个人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you meet this unicorn?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.09,0:27:28.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.29,0:27:35.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉温家兄弟地宫是空的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell the Winchester the crypt is empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.68,0:27:36.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后你再回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you can come back --
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.58,0:27:38.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那东西抵御天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's warded against angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.31,0:27:39.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以再回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you can come back --
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.32,0:27:41.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克劳力的爪牙还在镇上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley's demons are still in town,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.12,0:27:42.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且我们快没时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we're running out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.42,0:27:43.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.58,0:27:45.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解决它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.24,0:27:47.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.19,0:27:50.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是它\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.62,0:27:54.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.54,0:27:58.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是这里唯一抵御天使的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only thing in here warded against angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.61,0:28:37.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赢两次  吃鸡肉(拉斯维加斯俗语)\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winner, winner, chicken dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.96,0:28:44.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.00,0:28:47.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把它交给我  我把它带回天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hand it to me, and I'll take it to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.98,0:28:56.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我们要把它交给凯文让他翻译\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we will take it to Kevin so he can translate.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.17,0:28:58.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.26,0:28:59.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我马上拿去给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take it to him right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.86,0:29:02.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别磨蹭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No time to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.81,0:29:05.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他离得挺近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's not that far.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.00,0:29:08.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也一直想...去看看他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been meaning to... go check on him,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.75,0:29:09.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给他带些补给品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring him some supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.87,0:29:12.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果恶魔拿到了天使石碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the demons get their hands on the angel tablet,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.11,0:29:13.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们会把我们一网打尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}they'll kill us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.39,0:29:15.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们会摧毁天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll destroy heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.50,0:29:17.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以说服迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can reason with Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.54,0:29:19.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.96,0:29:21.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.11,0:29:23.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以给先知补充物资  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can resupply the prophet, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.22,0:29:26.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不如...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, why don't, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.62,0:29:29.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是我和萨姆把石碑拿给他吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}why don't Sam and I take it over to him,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.58,0:29:31.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你继续去执行你的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you can get back to your mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.56,0:29:34.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到另一半恶魔石碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finding the other half of the demon tablet --
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.21,0:29:36.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这才是首要任务  是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is priority, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.54,0:29:40.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能让你带走它  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't let you take that, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.09,0:29:43.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不能还是不肯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't or won't?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.39,0:29:45.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两者都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.11,0:29:56.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎样从炼狱里出来的  小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you get out of purgatory, Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.61,0:29:59.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定还有别的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}There has to be another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.02,0:30:01.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经演练过上千次了  卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have done this a thousand times, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.53,0:30:03.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.36,0:30:05.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.85,0:30:07.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后夺回石碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then take the tablet
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.60,0:30:09.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把它带回天堂  它就该放这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}and bring it home, where it belongs.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.60,0:30:11.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我你是怎样逃出炼狱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell me how you got out of purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.46,0:30:13.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对我说次实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be honest with me --
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.15,0:30:16.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算是你回来后的第一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the first time since you've been back --
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.46,0:30:17.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,石碑就给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.70,0:30:22.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait -- h-hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.68,0:30:24.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一部分我没听懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's one part I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.19,0:30:27.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你撞狗后停了车  为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hit a dog and stopped. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.88,0:30:32.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这整个故事  你就关心这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That whole story, and that's your takeaway?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.27,0:30:34.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听到其他的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I heard the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.49,0:30:36.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你爱上了一个特别的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fell in love with a unicorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.19,0:30:38.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她很漂亮  然后越来越悲剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was beautiful, then sad, then sadder.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.55,0:30:41.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笑过  哭过  吐过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I laughed, I cried, I puked in my mouth a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.67,0:30:45.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老实讲  我能理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}And honestly, I kind of get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.41,0:30:49.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.59,0:30:55.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got company.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.88,0:30:59.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.98,0:31:02.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡  我不知道你到底怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, I don't know what the hell is wrong with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.46,0:31:04.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但如果你在那里  你能听到我说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if you're in there and you can hear me,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.15,0:31:05.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不必这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}you don't have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.74,0:31:06.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.77,0:31:08.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是不对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.14,0:31:11.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你明白石碑对我们的用处吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you realize what that tablet can do for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.65,0:31:12.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.45,0:31:13.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}For heaven?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.80,0:31:15.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会伤害迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't hurt Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.28,0:31:17.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会  你会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. You will.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.61,0:31:18.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你正在伤害他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.55,0:31:20.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡  抗争  这不是真正的你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, fight this! This is not you!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.71,0:31:21.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与之抗争\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fight it!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.72,0:31:26.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你把我怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you done to me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.30,0:31:28.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放松  卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just relax, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.51,0:31:29.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你的肉身去做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let your vessel do
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.72,0:31:31.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你内心深知是正确的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}what you know deep down is the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.90,0:31:34.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你把我怎么了  娜奥米\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you done to me, Naomi?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.59,0:31:35.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,娜奥米是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's Naomi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.52,0:31:37.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把你怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have I done to you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.64,0:31:40.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道现在外面是什么情况吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea what it's like out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.54,0:31:44.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,生灵涂炭  都是你一手造成\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's blood everywhere, and it's on your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.90,0:31:49.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是因为你对我们  对天堂做的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}After everything you did -- to us, to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.47,0:31:52.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我治好了你  卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fixed you, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.58,0:31:54.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我治好了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fixed you!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.86,0:32:06.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.49,0:32:35.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这雷应该是打给我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe they're playing my song.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.03,0:32:43.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想要它\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.04,0:32:44.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.05,0:32:47.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你得先杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're gonna have to kill me first.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.39,0:32:50.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来啊  你个胆小鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, you coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.20,0:32:52.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,动手啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.32,0:32:53.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,动手啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.23,0:32:59.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.78,0:33:01.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点结束  卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}End this, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.81,0:33:07.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡  这不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass... this isn't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.81,0:33:09.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.14,0:33:12.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把石碑拿给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring me the tablet!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.49,0:33:16.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.93,0:33:17.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.93,0:33:20.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.61,0:33:22.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你能听见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you can hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.38,0:33:25.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.79,0:33:26.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.19,0:33:30.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是一家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're family.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.51,0:33:33.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.54,0:33:36.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.18,0:33:39.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须做出抉择  卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to choose, Castiel --
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.19,0:33:41.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们  还是他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Us or them.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.55,0:33:44.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.31,0:34:15.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.19,0:34:17.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel!!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.33,0:34:29.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.57,0:34:31.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.50,0:34:33.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡  小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass. Cass!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.15,0:34:45.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.93,0:34:48.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.46,0:34:51.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你把这里弄成这样  我很喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love what you've done with the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.71,0:34:55.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为这些能把我永远拦在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think all that was gonna keep me out forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.32,0:34:57.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少够让迪恩和小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least long enough for Dean and Cass
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.68,0:34:59.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿到石碑然后离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get the tablet and get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.33,0:35:00.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.17,0:35:03.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来是他到处插我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, that's who's been poking my boys --
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.14,0:35:04.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不是性感的那种插\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not in a sexy way.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.52,0:35:08.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得跟你理论理论了  小鹿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a bone to pick with you, moose.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.92,0:35:12.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看你对我的手下都做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}After what you did to my poor dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.04,0:35:15.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想把我们说死还是怎么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna talk us to death or get down to it already?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.02,0:35:17.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一点都没变啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's my whore.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.68,0:35:21.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我不是为了那些死人来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not here for my dearly departed, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.63,0:35:24.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我为了有奇怪铭文的石头而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here for the stone with the funny scribbles on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.00,0:35:26.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你做梦吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.17,0:35:28.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你放狠话的样子我太喜欢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love it when you get all tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.05,0:35:31.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恰到好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Touches me right where my bathing suit goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.53,0:35:35.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.72,0:35:39.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去救你哥哥  和我独一无二的他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save your brother... and my unicorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.29,0:35:45.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,彭彭和丁满\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timon and Pumbaa...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.86,0:35:49.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把大计划都告诉你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}...tell you their big plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.84,0:35:54.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们把想法都告诉你了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did they share that little chestnut with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.53,0:35:59.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们打算关上地狱之门  宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}They mean to close the gates of hell, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.62,0:36:04.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们打算杀了我和所有的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}They mean to kill me and all the demons --
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.70,0:36:05.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也包括你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You included.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.34,0:36:10.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,光是那句"杀了我"就够了  克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had me at "Kill you," Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.42,0:36:18.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说  这个娜奥米自从救你出炼狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, this "Naomi" has been controlling you
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.22,0:36:20.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就一直在控制你\N{\fnArial\fs30}since she got you out of purgatory?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.39,0:36:21.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.66,0:36:24.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么打破了这种控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, w-what broke the connection?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.59,0:36:26.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.93,0:36:31.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在只知道要保护这块石碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just know that I have to protect this tablet now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.41,0:36:34.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,防着娜奥米吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}From Naomi?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.83,0:36:35.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.40,0:36:40.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.11,0:36:44.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我  你在说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}From me? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.82,0:36:48.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.01,0:36:50.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.55,0:36:51.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-见鬼  -迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Damn it. - Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.13,0:36:53.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.83,0:36:55.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.30,0:36:57.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.64,0:36:58.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,梅格呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meg?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.88,0:37:00.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得走了  立刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to go -- now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.75,0:37:12.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能揍你到天荒地老\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could beat on you for eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.56,0:37:16.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猪头  随便你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take all the time you want, you pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.31,0:37:22.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后座上可没有小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}No Cass in the back seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.66,0:37:24.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的石碑早被拿走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your stone is long gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.68,0:37:53.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,娜奥米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naomi.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.28,0:37:57.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没想到在这儿见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fancy meeting you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.68,0:37:59.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好久不见啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven't seen you in a dark age.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.54,0:38:02.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢你的发型\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love the haircut.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.15,0:38:05.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你肩膀怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's the shoulder?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.62,0:38:08.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是一点皮肉之伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a flesh wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.75,0:38:12.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没拿到石碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I don't have the tablet,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.82,0:38:14.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你既然来了  那么你也没拿到\N{\fnArial\fs30}and if you're here, neither do you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.60,0:38:17.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也就是说你的卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means that your Castiel
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.49,0:38:19.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带着我们的东西跑掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}is in the wind with our prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.78,0:38:20.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我不了解你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I didn't know you better,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.60,0:38:23.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会说你是身手不行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say you're losing your touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.19,0:38:25.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥并没有跑掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel isn't in the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.08,0:38:28.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在做自己应该做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's doing exactly what he's supposed to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.90,0:38:30.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保护石碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Protect the tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.20,0:38:31.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连你也防着吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even from you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.24,0:38:34.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别激动  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy, love.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.10,0:38:37.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还记得我们在美索不达米亚的时候吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you remember our time in Mesopotamia the way I do,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.75,0:38:41.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是个情人  不是斗士\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know I'm a lover, not a fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.23,0:38:43.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底想怎样  贱货\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want, you cockroach?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.85,0:38:51.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许我们可以趁为时不晚  做笔交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we can make a deal before this gets truly bollocksed.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.42,0:38:53.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我肯定有你想要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I must have something that you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.28,0:38:59.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可是我的专长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tart stole my move.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.05,0:39:09.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那到底是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.11,0:39:13.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡碰了一下石碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, Cass touched the tablet,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.34,0:39:16.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就被还原成出场设置了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it reset him to his factory settings or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.18,0:39:17.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  我也不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. And I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.99,0:39:22.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只知道他带着天堂大规模杀伤性武器跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I know is that he is off the reservation with a-a heavenly WMD.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.36,0:39:29.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想再听任何人撒谎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, man, I can't take any more lies...from anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.71,0:39:39.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.41,0:39:42.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.27,0:39:47.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.47,0:39:49.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我应该告诉你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.36,0:39:52.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想相信自己没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I...just wanted to believe I was okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.34,0:39:52.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.94,0:39:54.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也听到小卡的话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you heard what Cass said...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.42,0:39:57.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第一项测试就把你伤得连他都无法治愈\N{\fnArial\fs30}That that first trial hurt you in ways that even he can't heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.02,0:40:01.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小萨姆  从现在开始你得对我坦诚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy, I need you to be honest with me from here on out, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.55,0:40:04.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.11,0:40:06.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.16,0:40:10.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也许不能承担这些测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I may not be able to carry the burden
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.87,0:40:12.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带来的重担\N{\fnArial\fs30}that comes along with these trials...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.38,0:40:15.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我可以帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can carry you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.81,0:40:22.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You...realize
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.29,0:40:25.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.29,0:40:25.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚才引用了《指环王》里的话吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}you kind of just quoted "Lord of The Rings", Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.11,0:40:27.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.12,0:40:27.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  那可是山姆啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man. But it's the Rudy hobbit, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.27,0:40:29.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,引用他的话不要紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rudy hobbit always gets a pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.27,0:40:29.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.64,0:40:30.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
